message:
README: document --ple-io and --kv-resident

--ple-io ram locks the n-gram table in RAM (no SSD reads on the prompt path);
--kv-resident 32768->20480 frees VRAM for the expert cache (measured hit 50%->78%).

Stage 1.6: docs + raw benchmark data

Docs/v100-stage1.6-final.md (stage report: bottleneck, flag-visibility chain,
isolation probes, MCE, keepers/rejected, correctness, remaining bottleneck);
STATE.md (1.5 + 1.6 complete); CHANGELOG.md (1.5 + 1.6 entries);
v100-performance.md (1.5 + 1.6 appended). Raw data Logs/{benchmarks,cpu,gpu}/s16-*.
(arena/async/sync/wc/sfendbg/waitit/lockflag/altflag/park/gov/minfreq/headdiag/base;
nsys-s16-*.nsys-rep/sqlite stay out of git per .gitignore, regenerable via
'nsys export --type sqlite').
